# Achieving True Power (bastok 85): Shamarhaan in Bastok Markets, the battlefield in the Navukgo Execution Chamber. The
# available guard (Puppetmaster Blues completed, main job PUP, main level 66), the offer 441 (the automaton's model id
# as its argument: no automaton set up, Harlequin's; its finish begins it), the accepted guard (PUP, level 66), 442, the
# Puppetmaster's Testimony traded (443: Prog 1, the testimony kept, the finish's own setPos into the Navukgo Execution
# Chamber); then the battlefield (scripts/battlefields/Navukgo_Execution_Chamber/achieving_true_power.lua: index 3,
# entry _1s0 by trading the testimony (requiredItems), PUP 66, maxPlayers 1, requiredVar 'Quest[1][85]Prog' at 1, which
# the finish of 443 just wrote: the battlefield's read of the quest's var; Shamarhaan and his automaton (SHAMARHAAN, +1)
# of area 1; his death alone wins it) and its win's 32001 (battlefieldWin 1123 while accepted): the level cap 70 raised
# to 75 (YOUR_LEVEL_LIMIT_IS_NOW_75), a Scroll of Instant Warp, completed (Master of Manipulation). The level guards are
# in #level65, the other jobs and the completed line in #completed, the cap not 70 (and a full bag) in
# #battlefield_cap75, a 32001 without the local var in #battlefield_novar. 443's setPos changes zone: `tick 400` and
# `login` finish it the way the harness's warp does; the GM warp after them puts the char at the gate and tells the flow
# checker the zone. The 32000 update's option is index << 4 | area (3 << 4 | 1 = 49). Shared: Shamarhaan is No Strings
# Attached's (available from level 30: progressEvent 434, which would compete with 441; set completed here) and
# Puppetmaster Blues' (accepted only). Default 433.
lists BastokMarkets/Shamarhaan/onTrigger BastokMarkets/Shamarhaan/onTrade BastokMarkets/onEventFinish/441 BastokMarkets/onEventFinish/443 NavukgoExecutionChamber/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=BastokMarkets pos=-285.4,-12,-83.2 job=PUP lvl=66
levelcap 70
quest AhtUrhgan.NoStringsAttached completed
item PuppetmastersTestimony
item BoneChip
login
trigger Shamarhaan                   # Puppetmaster Blues not completed: not offered, 433
finish-if-event
quest AhtUrhgan.PuppetmasterBlues completed
trade Shamarhaan PuppetmastersTestimony x1  # available: no trade handler, nothing
trigger Shamarhaan                   # the offer, 441 (model id)
finish                               # accepted
trigger Shamarhaan                   # accepted: 442
finish
trade Shamarhaan BoneChip x1         # no testimony: nil
trade Shamarhaan PuppetmastersTestimony x1  # 443
finish                               # Prog 1, setPos into the Navukgo Execution Chamber (the testimony kept)
tick 400
login                                # the zone change: Navukgo Execution Chamber
warp -598.5,8,-100 NavukgoExecutionChamber  # at the gate _1s0 (and the flow checker's zone)
trade _1s0 PuppetmastersTestimony x1  # Prog 1: the battlefield's 32000 menu (the quest names no _1s0)
update 32000 option=49               # index 3, area 1: registered, entered
finish                               # in the arena
kill SHAMARHAAN                      # area 1: won (his death alone ends it), battlefieldWin 1123, 32001 opens
finish                               # 32001: cap 70 -> 75 (YOUR_LEVEL_LIMIT_IS_NOW_75), the scroll, completed
